To whom ever this message concerns,

Greetings, my name is Anthony Rawlings and I so happened to have stumbled u=
pon Lojban through a general search online for languages best suited for le=
ss ambiguous conversations. I am a young individual with interests in philo=
sophy and consulting the deeper questions in life. To say the least, I have=
 found discussing deeper question in my native language (being English - Am=
erican) as being at times extremely frustrating. So, I am in search of a be=
tter medium of expression.
	With that said, I would being more than happy and appreciative to be place=
d on any mailing list that sends out regular content with regards to learni=
ng Lojban. If I may add a request for any helpful files/texts/videolinks=E2=
=80=A6 any resources in general that can offer me aid in acquiring this new=
 tool of expression. Again I am appreciative to any assistance that you or =
you all can provide to me.
	If you feel so incline to share also, a way to reciprocate value exchange.=
 I am interested in showing said appreciation through donations or whatever=
 means is available and convenient to you or your organization/group.

Thank you

Anthony Rawlings
Rawlings_aj@live.com

